        "title": "Extraordinary!",
        "text": "The whole area around the temple is an assault to all of your senses. The structure is a sacred Hindu temple with worship to Shiva. Surrounding the temple, you will encounter monkeys, wandering cows, hawkers, the Sadhu Babas and incense smell for starters. Then you will witness the 24/7 cremations. The whole thing is a mindblower. Advice is to be with a knowledgeable guide who can explain Shiva, the temple, the cremation rituals etc. If you can find our guide, Probin, get him - fantastic.\nA word of advice. People in our group and problems with their eyes with all of the smoke etc. You should tote some eye drops.\nWill never forget this experience.",
