        "title": "MUST-DO in Kathmandu",
        "text": "This experience was the BEST in Kathmandu. The only thing, it's easy to get ripped off. There are many frauds hanging out around the temple, ready to offer tourists a *deal*. Actually, never follow those people. We made that mistake the first time. The second time, we went without a *tour* guide. We went at exactly the right time on a Wednesday evening and got to go inside the temple and pray, not just struggle from a peephole. We saw all four faces of Pashupatinath and received His own flowers from His heads. Then we saw the holy saint Aadhi Shankara's shoes and Shiva lingas from different places. Amazing.",
