        "text": "Non- Hindu's cannot go inside the temple but you may roam the grounds.  The price for admission was slightly pricey and there are plenty of hagglers (with any tourist site in Kathmandu) but while culturally shocking (open air cremations), it is certainly worth a visit.  There are also good photo ops with the Sadus",
